    Sigma band sum edge 32 clean: min gap 1.72 meV.
  Sigma omega layout: sharded; Σ_c(ω,k,m,n) stays (m_X, n_Y)-tiled on the 2x2 mesh at logical/carrier=32/32 (consumers read tiles; no full-cube replication).

